msgstr "桌面快速鍵可以帶 Super/Ctrl/Alt 組合鍵;實體鍵由 evdev 直接監聽。"

msgid "Desktop shortcuts support combos like &lt;Super&gt;j; the physical key is monitored directly by evdev."
msgstr "桌面快速鍵支援 &lt;Super&gt;j 這類組合鍵;實體鍵則由 evdev 直接監聽。"

