msgid "Falls back to the built-in floating window; to get Myna's original placement, run bash scripts/install-gnome-extension.sh and re-login."
msgstr "會退回內建的懸浮視窗;想拿到 Myna 原版的定位,再執行 bash scripts/install-gnome-extension.sh 並登出重新登入"

