msgstr "主選單"

msgid "Microphone"
msgstr "麥克風"

msgid "Monitors /dev/input/event* directly; no desktop cooperation needed"
msgstr "直接監聽 /dev/input/event*,不需要桌面配合"

msgid "Myna behavior: drops the current dictation as soon as focus leaves"
msgstr "Myna 的行為:焦點一離開就丟棄本次內容"

msgid "Myna's hud-style (only affects the Myna capsule)"
msgstr "Myna 的 hud-style(僅對 Myna 膠囊生效)"

