msgstr "已就緒 · 按住「%s」說話,放開即輸入"

msgid "Ready · press %s to start, press again to stop"
msgstr "已就緒 · 按 %s 開始,再按一次結束"

msgid "Ready · press “%s” to start, press again to stop"
msgstr "已就緒 · 按「%s」開始,再按一次結束"

msgid "Recognition is done by Doubao's web service; login credentials are stored only on this machine."
msgstr "辨識由豆包的網頁服務完成;登入憑證只保存在本機。"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "重新整理"

msgid "Rendered by Myna's myna-hud; off falls back to the built-in floating window"
msgstr "由 Myna 的 myna-hud 繪製;關閉則用內建懸浮視窗"

